  "description": "The \u0027projects_summary\u0027 dataset provides a comprehensive overview of various projects, capturing essential details and performance metrics. It is designed to help project managers and stakeholders track project progress, understand project scope, and evaluate performance. Each project is uniquely identified by a \u0027projectKey\u0027 and described with a \u0027project_name\u0027 and \u0027shortDesc\u0027. The dataset includes detailed descriptions of project objectives and processes, as well as the \u0027project_owner\u0027 responsible for each project. Key performance indicators such as \u0027projectStatus\u0027, \u0027last_modified_timestamp\u0027, and \u0027most_recent_commit\u0027 provide insights into the current state and recent activities of the projects. Additionally, the dataset tracks the number of commits, unique committing users, and runtime statistics, which are crucial for assessing project activity and efficiency. The inclusion of \u0027tags\u0027 allows for categorization and easy retrieval of projects based on specific focus areas. This dataset is particularly useful for organizations using Dataiku DSS, as it integrates with the platform to provide real-time updates and facilitate data-driven decision-making. Overall, the \u0027projects_summary\u0027 dataset is a valuable tool for managing and optimizing project workflows.",
  "shortDesc": "Project management dataset with project details and performance metrics.",
